# Natalia, Bright Claw

> Natalia is not a jungler you draft for raw damage output. She is a pressure system: enemies who ordinarily walk the map alone now need escorts, and carries who stand at the edge of vision start hugging their tower instead. That psychological weight disappears the moment a Franco hook or a Saber spin enters the picture.

