## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-08-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Jungle Pickoff Default (Jungle)

- Items: Swift Boots, Blade of the Heptaseas, Endless Battle, Hunter Strike, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: Blade of the Heptaseas, Endless Battle, Hunter Strike
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Tough Boots over Swift Boots when Use when chain crowd control is the main reason Natalia cannot leave after the stealth auto.; Blade of Despair over Immortality when Use while ahead against low-control drafts where the next backline kill ends the fight.; Sea Halberd over Immortality when Use when healing, shields, or high-extra-HP fighters keep the marked target above kill range.
- Total cost: 11180 gold

Default jungle setup for farming a clean Heptaseas and Endless Battle ambush window, then using Ice Retribution and Hunter Strike movement to keep one carry trapped.

### Roam Dire Hit Ambush (Roam)

- Items: Rapid Boots, Blade of the Heptaseas, Sky Piercer, Hunter Strike, Malefic Roar, Blade of Despair
- Core: Blade of the Heptaseas, Sky Piercer, Hunter Strike
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Execute
- Blessing: Dire Hit
- Flex: Tough Boots over Rapid Boots when Use when the enemy has point-click control that can catch Natalia before the Camouflage attack and Execute resolve.; Immortality over Blade of Despair when Use before the final Lord fight when dying after one pick would lose more value than another damage slot adds.; Sea Halberd over Blade of Despair when Use when sustain or shielding stops the target from falling into Sky Piercer's execute threshold.
- Total cost: 11280 gold

Damage-roam setup for games where Natalia gives up jungle economy. Force stacks build on the walk between bushes, so the Camouflage teleport attack arrives loaded, and Sky Piercer plus Execute close whatever survives the opener.

### Anti-Sustain Armor Crack (Jungle)

