- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Endless Battle over Demon Hunter Sword when Use when the enemy backline is still reachable and one empowered basic attack matters more than front-to-back DPS.; Blade of Despair over Immortality when Use when armor is already cracked and Natalia can convert one more raw damage slot into a backline kill.; Rose Gold Meteor over Immortality when Use against magic burst when the shield and movement burst protect the first exit better than a revive.
- Total cost: 11070 gold

Anti-sustain jungle setup for drafts where Natalia cannot ignore high-HP fighters and must cut healing, armor, and current-HP pools before hunting the carry.

